                                "sense_id": "ca1b9cdb-89f5-3aba-929f-b0064ad3520c",
                                "text": "Unwanted tears rolled down my cheeks and I yearned for a mother's love. Then all was silent, save a bird that chirped as it sat on a box tree nearby. It twittered and twittered so blithesomely, so gleefully, that I brushed away the tears."
